@startuml sequence_CU06
' SIMPA - Sequence CU-06: Classify bunch maturity (RF-21, RF-22)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #006633
autonumber

actor "Harvester /\nTechnician" as C
participant "Mobile app" as APP
participant "REST API" as API
participant "AI service" as IA
participant "Explanation\nengine" as EXP
database "Central DB" as BD

C -> APP : selects block and "Classify bunch"
APP -> API : GET /block/{id}/variety
API --> APP : {variety, detachmentThreshold}

note right of APP
  RD-08: the threshold depends on the variety.
  guineensis = 3 fruits, hybrid = 5 (EV-04).
end note

C -> APP : captures photo of the basal part
APP -> API : POST /classification/maturity {image, threshold}
API -> IA : countDetachedFruits(image)
note right of IA
  RD-07: using color as a criterion
  is forbidden; color is misleading (EV-08).
end note
IA --> API : {detachedFruits, confidenceLevel}

API -> API : status = (fruits >= threshold) ? RIPE : GREEN
API -> EXP : generateExplanation(status, fruits, threshold)
note right of EXP
  "Contrastive" explanation:
  why ripe and not green,
  with reference to the threshold.
end note
EXP --> API : Explanation
API -> BD : persist MaturityClassification
API --> APP : {status, explanation}
APP --> C : shows status and explanation

C -> APP : requests block estimate before dispatch
APP -> API : GET /block/{id}/green-percentage
API -> BD : aggregate block classifications
BD --> API : greenPercentage

alt greenPercentage >= penalty threshold (RF-22)
  API -> BD : create preventive Alert
  API --> APP : alert {percentage, threshold}
  APP --> C : "penalty risk: do not dispatch yet"
else greenPercentage below threshold
  API --> APP : block fit for dispatch
end
@enduml
